// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Legacy helpers (parity) — round 3 step 3, 2026-05-06.
//
// Verbatim extracts of 16 module-level helpers from
// legacy/Inversion_atlas.html that the entry-point bodies expect to find.
// All are refactored to take `state` as first arg (legacy passed it via a
// global). Constants used by these helpers are defined first.
//
// Each helper has its legacy line range in the comment above it. If a
// future divergence is found, treat the legacy as authoritative.
//
// Replaces these round-2 stubs:
//   getPCRender, getLinesGrid, getLinesSignAt, getLinesValuesAt,
//   getL2Cluster, allSampleIdx.
//
// Adds these never-stubbed-before module-level helpers:
//   detectSchemaAndLayers, inferLayersFromV1, availablePCs, getPCByAxis,
//   getPC, buildIndexes, computePC1Signs, populateSimScales,
//   buildFamilyPalette, refreshBandPickBar, refreshCandidateUI,
//   listLayers, loadViewControls, reconcileViewControlsForData,
